WEBVTT

00:00:19.350 --> 00:00:26.170
Saint Seiya

00:01:32.330 --> 00:01:34.870
Beyond tens of billions of light years.

00:01:35.260 --> 00:01:37.780
Past immense darkness.

00:01:38.110 --> 00:01:44.650
The world you reach upstream
the Acheron River.

00:01:45.070 --> 00:01:48.900
The infinite pasture near the Lethe River.

00:01:50.240 --> 00:01:56.050
The utopia only those chosen
by God can enter after death.

00:01:57.180 --> 00:02:01.350
Where there is no hunger,
war, suffering or sadness.

00:02:01.580 --> 00:02:07.210
A haven of eternal peace free from evil.

00:02:08.080 --> 00:02:11.040
It is called Elysion.

00:02:13.110 --> 00:02:16.810
Now, go, young Saints of hope.

00:02:17.410 --> 00:02:19.690
We entrust Athena to you.

00:02:23.640 --> 00:02:25.060
Let's go, you guys!

00:02:30.280 --> 00:02:31.580
Let me speak...

00:02:32.160 --> 00:02:34.890
Let me speak once more.

00:02:35.540 --> 00:02:39.710
Young Bronze Saints.

00:02:39.840 --> 00:02:42.510
For love and peace on earth.

00:02:42.520 --> 00:02:43.610
We will go.

00:02:44.140 --> 00:02:47.050
With our lives and spirits!

00:02:47.480 --> 00:02:50.460
Burn now, Golden Cosmos!

00:02:51.180 --> 00:02:54.150
Show us a ray of light in
this world of darkness!

00:03:11.850 --> 00:03:14.140
Look. The Wailing Wall.

00:03:14.510 --> 00:03:15.410
Seiya.

00:03:16.050 --> 00:03:17.160
We did it!

00:03:17.310 --> 00:03:20.730
There's an opening in the Wailing Wall!

00:03:21.110 --> 00:03:22.950
Unbelievable.

00:03:22.950 --> 00:03:24.490
It's a tremendous power.

00:03:24.780 --> 00:03:28.060
With the power of only 12 mortals.

00:03:30.240 --> 00:03:31.700
The Gold Saints.

00:03:31.700 --> 00:03:33.160
Where are the Gold Saints?

00:03:34.840 --> 00:03:35.690
What's that?

00:03:36.880 --> 00:03:37.910
Old Master.

00:03:38.040 --> 00:03:39.940
My master, Camus!

00:03:40.940 --> 00:03:42.640
The Gold Saints.

00:03:43.440 --> 00:03:45.730
They have all passed.

00:03:45.970 --> 00:03:47.570
Yes, they have.

00:03:47.740 --> 00:03:52.510
Entrusting us with love,
peace and everything else.

00:03:52.880 --> 00:03:54.710
Old Master, Shura.

00:03:54.860 --> 00:03:56.820
My master, Camus.

00:03:56.940 --> 00:04:01.350
Shaka, Mu, Aphrodite, Miro.

00:04:01.540 --> 00:04:04.510
Aioros, Aioria, Deathmask.

00:04:04.510 --> 00:04:06.940
Saga, and Aldebaran!

00:04:08.240 --> 00:04:12.080
Thanks to the sacrifice of the Gold Saints,

00:04:12.180 --> 00:04:14.580
the Wailing Wall has been destroyed

00:04:14.590 --> 00:04:16.910
and the path to Elysion cleared.

00:04:18.660 --> 00:04:19.750
Elysion.

00:04:20.480 --> 00:04:26.190
It is said the real body of Hades lies there.

00:04:28.380 --> 00:04:31.870
Hurry, young Saints of hope.

00:04:32.240 --> 00:04:38.440
The world is in danger of falling

00:04:38.620 --> 00:04:41.350
under Hades' Greatest Eclipse.

00:04:42.050 --> 00:04:50.070
Death Battle to Elysion

00:04:55.740 --> 00:04:56.610
Let's go.

00:04:57.280 --> 00:05:01.130
The Gold Saints gave up
their lives to open the way.

00:05:01.940 --> 00:05:03.650
We can't let it go to waste.

00:05:04.820 --> 00:05:08.050
We aim for where Athena is and
the real body of Hades lies.

00:05:09.020 --> 00:05:10.270
Elysion!

00:05:18.970 --> 00:05:20.690
What's wrong, Shiryu?

00:05:21.480 --> 00:05:24.790
Nothing. Go ahead, I'll be right there.

00:05:24.980 --> 00:05:25.940
All right.

00:05:36.240 --> 00:05:38.880
Alraune Queen.

00:05:38.890 --> 00:05:41.560
Minotauros Gordon.

00:05:41.560 --> 00:05:44.090
Basilisk Sylphid.

00:05:44.680 --> 00:05:48.940
Unfortunately, we won't let a
single Saint get to Elysion.

00:05:48.980 --> 00:05:51.460
Now, get out of the way, Dragon.

00:05:51.650 --> 00:05:54.430
If you want to pass, you have to defeat me.

00:05:54.780 --> 00:05:55.910
Fool.

00:05:56.290 --> 00:06:00.120
Do you intend to take three
of us on by yourself?

00:06:09.470 --> 00:06:11.310
What can you do by yourself?

00:06:11.310 --> 00:06:12.880
What a nuisance.

00:06:24.780 --> 00:06:26.850
The holy sword, Excalibur.

00:06:27.930 --> 00:06:34.030
Listen, we Bronze Saints possess
inheritances from the Gold Saints.

00:06:35.550 --> 00:06:37.520
Dragon, you bastard.

00:06:37.810 --> 00:06:39.470
You plan to die here.

00:06:39.720 --> 00:06:44.520
I have been prepared for death.
Witness my final attack.

00:06:48.080 --> 00:06:48.640
I see it.

00:06:49.040 --> 00:06:51.660
That's the Wailing Wall's exit.

00:06:53.800 --> 00:06:54.770
What's this?

00:07:04.870 --> 00:07:05.810
Another dimension?

00:07:06.110 --> 00:07:09.550
And time and space are distorted.

00:07:10.230 --> 00:07:15.000
This is really a place only God can pass.

00:07:17.910 --> 00:07:19.590
Seiya, look at that light.

00:07:22.780 --> 00:07:26.790
Is Elysion in that direction?

00:07:27.110 --> 00:07:31.600
There will be Miss Saori who
went chasing after Hades.

00:07:31.710 --> 00:07:35.260
And she's waiting for the Athena Cloth!

00:07:35.530 --> 00:07:36.720
All right!

00:07:37.200 --> 00:07:38.720
We will take a chance.

00:07:39.110 --> 00:07:40.170
Let's go.

00:07:43.160 --> 00:07:44.290
I won't let you go.

00:07:47.540 --> 00:07:48.390
That's...

00:07:48.390 --> 00:07:48.880
Minos.

00:07:51.040 --> 00:07:54.820
Bastard, didn't you die in the explosion?

00:08:01.010 --> 00:08:02.400
The Wailing Wall.

00:08:03.670 --> 00:08:04.870
The Gold Saints.

00:08:13.160 --> 00:08:17.260
There's no way that Minos, one
of the Underworld's big three,

00:08:17.260 --> 00:08:19.480
would die in such fashion.

00:08:19.580 --> 00:08:25.320
And I can't let you scum reach Elysion.

00:08:25.530 --> 00:08:26.650
Hyoga!

00:08:28.370 --> 00:08:29.670
Move aside, Cygnus.

00:08:33.040 --> 00:08:34.780
What? Impossible.

00:08:35.540 --> 00:08:37.550
When did this wall of ice appear?

00:08:37.670 --> 00:08:41.330
That ice wall is a form
of the Freezing Coffin.

00:08:41.610 --> 00:08:46.500
Even someone with the might of
the Gold Saints can't break it.

00:08:47.270 --> 00:08:51.510
Behave yourself while we safely
cross to the other side.

00:08:51.510 --> 00:08:52.380
Foolish.

00:08:52.920 --> 00:08:57.010
Do you think you can stop me
with this thin sheet of ice?

00:08:57.140 --> 00:08:59.120
I told you it was no use.

00:08:59.380 --> 00:09:00.590
Fool!

00:09:07.290 --> 00:09:08.120
What?

00:09:08.540 --> 00:09:12.610
Hyoga! Forget Minos and jump!

00:09:14.140 --> 00:09:17.890
To break the ice wall that I
learned from my master Camus,

00:09:18.000 --> 00:09:20.510
you are truly one of the
Underworld's big three.

00:09:20.810 --> 00:09:21.920
Minos!

00:09:22.610 --> 00:09:24.610
Hyoga, hurry and jump!

00:09:24.610 --> 00:09:25.740
Jump, Hyoga!

00:09:26.070 --> 00:09:31.300
No! If I also jump, all three
of us will be vulnerable.

00:09:31.670 --> 00:09:33.490
Until you two make it safely,

00:09:33.960 --> 00:09:36.990
I'll have to stop him with my body.

00:09:37.970 --> 00:09:40.540
Stop me with your body?

00:09:40.820 --> 00:09:45.410
If you interrupt me any further,
I'll just take care of you first.

00:09:45.580 --> 00:09:49.250
That'll never happen.
Take this! Diamond Dust!

00:09:54.080 --> 00:09:55.260
-Hyoga! -Hyoga!

00:09:57.410 --> 00:09:58.610
Don't you understand?

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:02.440
Your freezing skill has no effect on me.

00:10:02.940 --> 00:10:04.190
Now, stand up!

00:10:05.990 --> 00:10:08.110
If you can't, I'll make you.

00:10:09.810 --> 00:10:11.290
What's this?

00:10:11.440 --> 00:10:15.310
My body is moving against my will.

00:10:16.210 --> 00:10:20.620
Your body is being manipulated
by invisible strings.

00:10:20.620 --> 00:10:22.510
The dance to death,

00:10:22.520 --> 00:10:24.580
Cosmic Marionation!

00:10:26.760 --> 00:10:29.220
Now die, Cygnus!

00:10:34.910 --> 00:10:39.260
What a pressure! It feels like my
Cloth and body will be crumbled.

00:10:39.890 --> 00:10:44.060
And we're being blow away from Elysion.

00:10:44.110 --> 00:10:45.920
Seiya!

00:10:46.280 --> 00:10:47.020
Shun!

00:10:47.930 --> 00:10:49.340
Shun!

00:10:50.690 --> 00:10:53.290
Maybe it was impossible for us mortals.

00:10:54.110 --> 00:10:58.620
Only God is able to travel
the path to Elysion.

00:10:59.830 --> 00:11:05.400
Even with this ultimate Cloth
revived by Athena's blood.

00:11:08.140 --> 00:11:09.130
What's this?

00:11:13.250 --> 00:11:16.950
Wings? The Pegasus Cloth grew out wings!

00:11:17.420 --> 00:11:18.900
All right! Shun!

00:11:21.840 --> 00:11:23.030
I can fly as I wish!

00:11:26.640 --> 00:11:28.140
Are you all right, Shun?

00:11:29.580 --> 00:11:30.540
Seiya.

00:11:30.880 --> 00:11:32.390
What are those wings?

00:11:32.480 --> 00:11:33.980
I don't know.

00:11:35.170 --> 00:11:39.910
But the Pegasus Cloth possessed
wings from the beginning.

00:11:40.160 --> 00:11:45.030
The ability must have been
triggered by Athena's blood.

00:11:45.170 --> 00:11:48.130
As Shion and Old Master said,

00:11:48.300 --> 00:11:52.480
this Cloth revived by Athena's
blood is not a fake.

00:11:53.060 --> 00:11:58.160
And I feel like we haven't
unlocked its fullest potential.

00:11:58.240 --> 00:11:59.200
Seiya.

00:11:59.920 --> 00:12:01.240
Let's go, Shun.

00:12:01.560 --> 00:12:06.210
We can get to Elysion with these wings.

00:12:06.260 --> 00:12:07.670
Now, let's go!

00:12:13.100 --> 00:12:18.220
How does it feel, Cygnus, to be
manipulated by my Cosmic Marionation?

00:12:18.430 --> 00:12:21.440
Shall I show you mercy
and rip apart your limbs?

00:12:21.710 --> 00:12:23.990
What? What is this?

00:12:24.890 --> 00:12:28.960
The strings of the Cosmic
Marionation are frozen.

00:12:30.780 --> 00:12:35.430
It seems the other two went far away.

00:12:35.490 --> 00:12:37.110
Went far away?

00:12:37.770 --> 00:12:43.210
Did you try to buy time for the other two

00:12:43.440 --> 00:12:47.820
and intentionally get hit
with my Cosmic Marionation?

00:12:47.920 --> 00:12:49.280
Not just that.

00:12:49.360 --> 00:12:50.140
What?

00:12:50.260 --> 00:12:52.360
My body won't move.

00:12:52.900 --> 00:12:54.090
What's this chill?

00:12:54.400 --> 00:12:59.050
How does it feel to get
hit with your own attack?

00:12:59.050 --> 00:13:01.530
Cygnus, you bastard.

00:13:01.890 --> 00:13:05.000
I'll have you let me go to Elysion too.

00:13:09.540 --> 00:13:14.500
Take this! My ultimate attack
taught to me by my master, Camus!

00:13:15.110 --> 00:13:17.510
Aurora Execution!

00:13:19.570 --> 00:13:20.740
Seiya, Shun!

00:13:20.880 --> 00:13:22.010
I'm going now!

00:13:23.730 --> 00:13:25.750
This is... Minos!

00:13:26.930 --> 00:13:32.820
One Cosmic Marionation string
is still intact and connects us.

00:13:33.480 --> 00:13:36.160
I won't let you go to Elysion.

00:13:37.480 --> 00:13:39.130
Die, Cygnus!

00:13:41.100 --> 00:13:42.010
What?

00:13:44.190 --> 00:13:45.640
No way!

00:13:46.050 --> 00:13:48.340
Pegasus and Cygnus are all right,

00:13:48.350 --> 00:13:51.530
so why just my Surplice?

00:13:53.020 --> 00:13:54.080
What the...

00:13:54.890 --> 00:13:57.460
Minos disappeared without a trace.

00:13:57.650 --> 00:14:00.730
Like he was sucked into another dimension.

00:14:01.020 --> 00:14:04.590
This space is really only for God.

00:14:04.930 --> 00:14:09.470
If we didn't have the Cloths
revived by Athena's blood,

00:14:09.470 --> 00:14:12.480
the same would have happened to us.

00:14:13.280 --> 00:14:14.060
What about Shiryu?

00:14:24.490 --> 00:14:27.940
To go against the three of us alone.

00:14:28.320 --> 00:14:30.910
You now realize how reckless it is of you.

00:14:30.980 --> 00:14:33.080
Now, get out of the way, Dragon.

00:14:34.190 --> 00:14:35.900
Don't make me say this again...

00:14:36.080 --> 00:14:39.060
If you want to pass, you have to defeat me.

00:14:39.230 --> 00:14:40.580
This bastard.

00:14:40.580 --> 00:14:41.970
Wait, Gordon.

00:14:42.180 --> 00:14:43.030
Fine.

00:14:43.410 --> 00:14:47.420
If you really want to die,
I will grant you your wish.

00:14:47.610 --> 00:14:51.050
I will take off your head.

00:14:51.690 --> 00:14:52.800
Take this!

00:14:55.270 --> 00:14:57.310
Blood Flower Scissors!

00:15:06.180 --> 00:15:08.130
He kept us a while.

00:15:08.280 --> 00:15:10.140
Now, let's go you two.

00:15:10.740 --> 00:15:12.630
What? What's this?

00:15:12.630 --> 00:15:14.490
Queen, this man.

00:15:15.040 --> 00:15:19.850
When did he get past the Blood Flower
Scissors to take hold of the Excalibur?

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:24.310
I'll demolish the Excalibur.

00:15:24.310 --> 00:15:25.080
Take this!

00:15:25.080 --> 00:15:27.120
My ax!

00:15:30.010 --> 00:15:32.790
Grand Ax Crusher!

00:15:32.860 --> 00:15:33.810
Excalibur!

00:15:38.490 --> 00:15:43.460
Even the Excalibur can't stand
up against Minotauros's ax.

00:15:43.810 --> 00:15:46.550
Your arm will be broken

00:15:46.560 --> 00:15:49.650
and you won't be able to use the Excalibur.

00:15:50.650 --> 00:15:54.180
Now I'll break your head into pieces.

00:15:54.180 --> 00:15:55.340
Die, Dragon!

00:15:56.540 --> 00:15:57.870
Rising!

00:15:57.870 --> 00:15:58.650
What?

00:15:58.760 --> 00:16:00.600
Dragon!

00:16:06.600 --> 00:16:07.610
Gordon!

00:16:16.270 --> 00:16:20.240
I see. One who is prepared
for death is fearsome.

00:16:20.640 --> 00:16:23.240
It seems you won't budge.

00:16:24.310 --> 00:16:26.180
Queen chopped your head.

00:16:27.200 --> 00:16:29.900
Gordon broke the Excalibur.

00:16:30.650 --> 00:16:35.840
Left here alone, you will probably die.

00:16:36.410 --> 00:16:40.950
However, as long as you have
friends who are headed to Elysion,

00:16:41.490 --> 00:16:44.140
I can't wait for that to happen.

00:16:50.530 --> 00:16:53.440
I'll have to make you get
out of our way, Dragon!

00:16:53.480 --> 00:16:56.790
Take my strong gust of wind.

00:16:56.790 --> 00:16:58.690
And fly away to another dimension!

00:16:58.950 --> 00:17:00.590
Annihilation Flap!

00:17:11.730 --> 00:17:12.960
Did you die?

00:17:14.740 --> 00:17:16.530
It's ironic.

00:17:16.850 --> 00:17:18.450
What?

00:17:18.450 --> 00:17:21.590
Normally, I would have been blown

00:17:22.090 --> 00:17:26.260
to another dimension by that one blow.

00:17:26.380 --> 00:17:32.040
But the Wailing Wall caught my body.

00:17:32.510 --> 00:17:36.570
You might have been
betrayed by your own side.

00:17:37.660 --> 00:17:38.870
Nonsense.

00:17:38.980 --> 00:17:42.360
Give it up. Do you not realize it is no use?

00:17:42.420 --> 00:17:43.580
What?

00:17:44.020 --> 00:17:46.820
No matter how hard you try,

00:17:46.980 --> 00:17:49.280
you cannot defeat me.

00:17:49.650 --> 00:17:51.720
All three of you, attack me at once.

00:17:52.310 --> 00:17:54.980
Shut up, you dead man!

00:17:59.840 --> 00:18:03.390
Dragon Flight!

00:18:06.610 --> 00:18:07.890
Sylphid!
Sylphid!

00:18:09.340 --> 00:18:14.120
Do you understand? If you want
to defeat me, attack me at once!

00:18:14.640 --> 00:18:18.550
That's when I'll show you my final attack.

00:18:18.550 --> 00:18:19.560
What?

00:18:20.840 --> 00:18:23.780
Final attack? Fine.

00:18:23.960 --> 00:18:26.140
We'll take your life as you wish!

00:18:26.420 --> 00:18:27.510
Dragon!

00:18:28.460 --> 00:18:29.480
Alraune!

00:18:29.680 --> 00:18:30.890
Minotauros!

00:18:31.140 --> 00:18:32.450
Basilisk!

00:18:32.960 --> 00:18:35.830
We'll combine forces!

00:18:36.110 --> 00:18:40.620
Come. I only have strength
for one more attack.

00:18:43.960 --> 00:18:45.150
Shunrei.

00:18:46.190 --> 00:18:50.760
Are you still praying at Five Ancient Peaks?

00:18:52.680 --> 00:18:56.180
You have always continued to pray for me.

00:18:57.920 --> 00:19:02.210
But this is the final fight.

00:19:03.180 --> 00:19:05.590
The last one, Shunrei.

00:19:07.510 --> 00:19:08.490
Shiryu.

00:19:09.840 --> 00:19:12.140
Shiryu, no!

00:19:15.910 --> 00:19:17.690
Now, let's go!

00:19:17.840 --> 00:19:19.290
Die, Dragon!

00:19:19.620 --> 00:19:22.100
Blood Flower Scissors!

00:19:22.310 --> 00:19:24.590
Grand Ax Crusher!

00:19:25.040 --> 00:19:27.240
Annihilation Flap!

00:19:27.640 --> 00:19:32.250
Old Master, I will use all the
power that you have given me now!

00:19:35.490 --> 00:19:39.360
Rising Hundred Dragons!

00:19:40.910 --> 00:19:42.120
What?

00:19:55.090 --> 00:19:58.830
By the impact of his Rising Hundred
Dragons attack against theirs

00:19:59.040 --> 00:20:00.710
I was blown so far away!

00:20:03.310 --> 00:20:05.070
What pressure!

00:20:05.440 --> 00:20:06.680
Where is this?

00:20:10.820 --> 00:20:12.320
My body is drifting away.

00:20:14.070 --> 00:20:15.050
Hyoga.

00:20:15.050 --> 00:20:16.430
I've been waiting, Shiryu.

00:20:16.580 --> 00:20:18.780
Hyoga, what are those wings?

00:20:19.270 --> 00:20:22.540
They're the wings Athena
gave us to get to Elysion.

00:20:22.540 --> 00:20:24.430
Now, let's go. Everyone is waiting.

00:20:26.400 --> 00:20:27.360
Wait!

00:20:29.670 --> 00:20:30.740
Basilisk.

00:20:31.030 --> 00:20:32.330
I won't let you...

00:20:32.530 --> 00:20:35.720
I won't let you go to Elysion!

00:20:35.860 --> 00:20:40.700
Give it up. If you jump here,
your body will be pulverized.

00:20:40.940 --> 00:20:42.050
What?

00:20:46.940 --> 00:20:48.740
That's why I warned you.

00:20:48.840 --> 00:20:52.190
We are protected by the blood of Athena.

00:20:53.650 --> 00:20:54.780
I see.

00:20:55.180 --> 00:21:01.110
Now I realize why Rhadamanthys
warned us about you!

00:21:02.180 --> 00:21:03.680
Back then.

00:21:04.350 --> 00:21:06.150
If only I killed you back then.

00:21:14.350 --> 00:21:15.520
He has vanished.

00:21:15.750 --> 00:21:19.850
Let's go, Shiryu. The place
of the final battle, Elysion.

00:21:20.280 --> 00:21:22.440
What about Seiya and Shun?

00:21:22.770 --> 00:21:24.050
They went ahead.

00:21:24.050 --> 00:21:29.690
By now, they must have reached
Elysion with Pegasus's wings.

00:21:29.690 --> 00:21:31.120
Let's hurry, Hyoga.

00:21:31.380 --> 00:21:34.460
I'm worried about them,
but also about Miss Saori.

00:21:46.980 --> 00:21:48.250
Seiya.

00:21:51.980 --> 00:21:53.390
Seiya-chan.

00:22:00.260 --> 00:22:01.530
Miss Saori.

00:22:01.870 --> 00:22:03.570
Athena.

00:22:06.740 --> 00:22:07.720
Where am I?

00:22:11.580 --> 00:22:13.490
Such a beauty.

00:22:14.280 --> 00:22:18.200
This is the eternal paradise

00:22:18.320 --> 00:22:21.600
where only those selected by God can enter.

00:22:22.630 --> 00:22:23.830
This is...

00:22:25.240 --> 00:22:28.710
This is Elysion.

00:24:04.350 --> 00:24:07.340
We finally make it to
the eternal paradise, Elysion.

00:24:07.630 --> 00:24:11.630
Ikki follows. Pandora approaches
behind him in tears,

00:24:11.630 --> 00:24:15.690
and tells him of her tragic past,
and asks him to grant her wish.

00:24:16.130 --> 00:24:18.160
Where are Athena and Hades?

00:24:18.670 --> 00:24:21.040
Two shadows appear in front of me
as I wander this unknown realm...

00:24:21.430 --> 00:24:24.490
Hades' two closest servants.

00:24:24.780 --> 00:24:27.400
Saint Seiya:
Gods of Death and Sleep

00:24:27.590 --> 00:24:30.330
Have you ever felt your Cosmo?
